    // f: asserted for exactly one cycle after resetn deasserted (next posedge)
    // g: after x sequence 1,0,1 occurs in 3 successive cycles, g is asserted for up to 2 cycles.
    //     If y==1 within those 2 cycles, g becomes permanently 1; otherwise g becomes permanently 0.

